# This repo holds design docs under docs/. Hermes Agent (Nous) uses its own config — see:
# https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/docs/reference/environment-variables
#
# Doctor-agent (`../ai-doctor-agent/backend`, sibling repo) keeps its own `.env` for Firebase, etc.
# When you add MCP or internal routes for Agent integration, document variables there, e.g.:
# AGENT_MCP_BEARER_TOKEN=change-me
# INTERNAL_AGENT_CONTEXT_ROUTE_ENABLED=false
